      "message": "Should we upstream this first? (If this optimization is useful and correct, it should be useful for the original upstream IOMMU driver, i.e. without pKVM, as well?)\n\nI know in the newest kernel this code is entirely refactored and the cache flush is in a completely different place (in drivers/iommu/iommu-pages.h in iommu_pages_flush_incoherent()) but I see it is still CLFLUSH.",
